    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνείδ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reproachful,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνειδείοις ἐπέεσσι</span> with words
				<i>of reproach,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.519
			</span></i>, etc. ; once in <i><span class="en">Od., 18.326</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. μῦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.393
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dishonourable,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωμὸς ὀ.,</span> of the fruits of
			begging, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.573
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Ammian.
			</span></i>).</div>
